  m_Name: Evento_CidadeViraPoloDeDataCenters
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Metis.Runtime::KnowledgeEntryData
  _title: Cidade Vira Polo de Data Centers
  _titleEn: City Becomes a Data Center Hub
  _category: 1
  _unlockTrigger: 0
  _summary: "Data centers trazem investimento e impostos, mas consomem muita eletricidade
    e \xE1gua para resfriamento."
  _summaryEn: Data centers bring investment and taxes, but consume a lot of electricity
    and water for cooling.
  _realWorld: "Na Irlanda, os data centers j\xE1 consumiam mais de 20% da eletricidade
    do pa\xEDs em 2023, segundo o escrit\xF3rio nacional de estat\xEDstica."
  _realWorldEn: In Ireland, data centers already used more than 20% of the country's
    electricity in 2023, according to the national statistics office.
  _tradeOffs: "Geram poucos empregos para o tamanho do investimento e disputam energia
    e \xE1gua com a popula\xE7\xE3o."
  _tradeOffsEn: They create few jobs for the size of the investment and compete with
    residents for power and water.
  _sources:
  - Label: CSO Irlanda, consumo de eletricidade de data centers em 2023
    Url: https://www.cso.ie/en/releasesandpublications/ep/p-dcmec/datacentresmeteredelectricityconsumption2023/
